																		Thanks, Attributions, Homage and Other Matters
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606142819" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1436583970 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">11 Jul 2015 03:06</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2335898">
									

<p>Firstly, allow me to thank some reviewers such as azzleflux, KholetteDrake, SoundChaser among others for them reading through and giving me guidance.</p>
<ul>
<li>Picture 1 credited to Pixbay (<a href="https://pixabay.com/en/squid-fountain-ink-pen-silhouette-153604/">https://pixabay.com/en/squid-fountain-ink-pen-silhouette-153604/</a>) under CC0 Public Domain</li>
<li>Picture 2 credited to Wikipedia (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Callistoctopus_ornatus">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Callistoctopus_ornatus</a>) under CC0 Public Domain</li>
</ul>
<p>This SCP article is an unofficial &quot;rewrite in spirit&quot; (re: reimagining) of a previous version of SCP-2698 by DreamwalkerFae, who was in turn prompted by MrCobalt&#8230;</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A &quot;tentacle monster&quot; that is sentient, capable of speech, and actually rather cultured. Wants/is trying to sue Japan for defamation.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>That said, I failed to adhere to the challenge since tentacle erotica is not stated-owned and is <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tentacle_erotica">not exclusively Japanese.</a></p>
<p>There are some homages to Lovecraftian genre as a whole.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Besides the obvious Laundry Files references, the &quot;Dark Ocean&quot; is based on Digimon&#8230; whereby the Dark Ocean is an alternate dimension inhabited by unknown creatures resembling the Deep Ones.</p>
<p>SCP-2698-A claims to be a high priest, a title held by Cthulhu. And humans being larvae echoes back to the Deep Ones.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

