														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2335992">
									

<p>Perhaps Sapient? Sentience implies the ability to feel (which it does appear to have as well). Neither term applies exclusively to physicality, just to consciousness.</p>
<p>I like the idea of summoning a servant-of-the-elder-gods into a &quot;fishtank&quot;. I get a bit of a chuckle of it believing a researcher to be an Elder God; hope nobody educates it otherwise&#8230;</p>
<p>What I wonder is the Foundation's inability to isolate this thing. Does it mystically connect to a nearby source? If it is already within a faraday cage yet still able to connect to the internet, what purpose is it serving? Ideally, we can contain this by just unplugging it from any outside communications.</p>

							</div>

								
					
