<p>After some self-time, I think I will cut out &quot;sentient&quot; altogether and go with &quot;organisms or automatons&quot;.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>hope nobody educates it otherwise…</p>
</blockquote>
<p>In an earlier version, I have Dr. Tarou note that it is a strategy to interact with 2698-A. I cut that out, so that readers would figure that out for themselves.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>What I wonder is the Foundation's inability to isolate this thing.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The Faraday cage does the job. It accesses the Internet like any normal computer would. Even more ideally, the best way to disconnect it is to turn it off.</p>

